# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use case examples {#use-case-examples}"
msgstr "Contoh kasus penggunaan {#use-case-examples}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This technique has been used to implement lower-depth Trotter circuits for the time-evolution of a 2D spin model [\\[1\\]](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41534-026-01196-0).\n"
msgstr "Teknik ini telah digunakan untuk mengimplementasikan circuit Trotter berkedalaman lebih rendah untuk evolusi waktu model spin 2D [\\[1\\]](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41534-026-01196-0).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Technical discussion {#technical-discussion}"
msgstr "Pembahasan teknis {#technical-discussion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**A single entry point:** the `backpropagate` function performs OBP.\n"
msgstr "**Satu titik masuk:** fungsi `backpropagate` menjalankan OBP.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Two independent controls over the depth ↔ accuracy tradeoff:**\n"
msgstr "**Dua kontrol independen untuk tradeoff kedalaman ↔ akurasi:**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '    *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`OperatorBudget` bounds how large the observable may grow during backpropagation.\n"
msgstr "`OperatorBudget` membatasi seberapa besar observable boleh tumbuh selama backpropagation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '    *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`TruncationErrorBudget` bounds how much error may be incurred during backpropagation.\n"
msgstr "`TruncationErrorBudget` membatasi seberapa besar error yang boleh timbul selama backpropagation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Effectiveness depends on how Clifford the circuit is:** for high-magic circuits (i.e. very non-Clifford), terms added to the observable tend to have larger coefficients, so one incurs more truncation error earlier, limiting the depth savings under a fixed error budget. Near-Clifford circuits can be truncated more aggressively and backpropagated deeper under the same budget.\n"
msgstr "**Efektivitas tergantung seberapa Clifford circuit-nya:** untuk circuit dengan magic tinggi (yaitu sangat non-Clifford), suku-suku yang ditambahkan ke observable cenderung punya koefisien lebih besar, sehingga error truncation muncul lebih awal dan membatasi penghematan kedalaman di bawah budget error yang tetap. Circuit yang mendekati Clifford bisa dipotong lebih agresif dan di-backpropagate lebih dalam dengan budget yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Fully introspectable:** each run returns an `OBPMetadata` object recording per-slice Pauli counts, QWC-group counts, and accumulated truncation error, with `plot_*` helpers to visualize operator growth and error against circuit depth — useful for tuning budgets before committing QPU time.\n"
msgstr "**Sepenuhnya bisa diinspeksi:** setiap run mengembalikan objek `OBPMetadata` yang mencatat jumlah Pauli per slice, jumlah grup QWC, dan akumulasi error truncation, dengan helper `plot_*` untuk memvisualisasikan pertumbuhan operator dan error terhadap kedalaman circuit — berguna untuk menyetel budget sebelum memakai waktu QPU.\n"

