msgid "Deprecation policy {#deprecation-policy}"
msgstr "Kebijakan deprecation {#deprecation-policy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package follows [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/). We may occasionally make breaking changes in order to improve the user experience. When possible, we will keep old interfaces and mark them as deprecated, as long as they can co-exist with the new ones. Each substantial improvement, breaking change, or deprecation will be documented in the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-paulice/release-notes).\n"
msgstr "Package ini mengikuti [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/). Sesekali kami mungkin membuat perubahan yang merusak (breaking changes) demi meningkatkan pengalaman pengguna. Kalau memungkinkan, kami akan mempertahankan antarmuka lama dan menandainya sebagai deprecated, selama masih bisa berdampingan dengan yang baru. Setiap peningkatan besar, breaking change, atau deprecation akan didokumentasikan di [catatan rilis](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-paulice/release-notes).\n"

